    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the brave adventuring duo <i>Cappy &amp; Tappy</i> as they quest through dangerous temples to find treasures lost to time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359860/extras/27e1fba87dec70e304c7dd4bfe5127c3.poster.avif?t=1754408112\" width=1040 height=644 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359860/extras/27e1fba87dec70e304c7dd4bfe5127c3.webm?t=1754408112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359860/extras/27e1fba87dec70e304c7dd4bfe5127c3.mp4?t=1754408112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control both Cappy &amp; Tappy simultaneously for one-of-a-kind solo platforming, or grab a friend and play the fascinating asymmetric co-op mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize both building and platforming to escape with your life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb and leap away from the ever-encroaching, piranha-infested water beneath your feet!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jam out to our original soundtrack, hosting a wide variety of handheld game-inspired tunes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take in the dazzling and varied atmospheres of each unique world that your adventure brings you to!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a constant stream of new mechanics that challenge your skills and invite creative problem solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Champion each world by collecting all of the idols found within!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of the Temples of Peril...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359860/extras/313af0641a1b5c4483195663d57fdf5d.avif?t=1754408112\" width=188 height=174 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Reviews</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I haven't felt platforming this good since super meat boy&quot;</i> - Seth Macy, IGN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I love me a good asymmetrical co-op game&quot; - Kotaku</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I never knew how much I wanted to play Tetris and a 2D platformer at the same time until now!&quot; - mjoldham</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Hazards and Helpers</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359860/extras/e4f430e4f75a5dfe6bf3220d4ec9d1bb.avif?t=1754408112\" width=500 height=500 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campfire</strong>: Respawn points, run through to activate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idol</strong>: Collectables for an extra challenge, not needed to complete the level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spikes: </strong>If hit, you'll respawn at the highest campfire (watch out!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holds</strong>: Grab onto and launch from these for fast and fun traversal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breaker: </strong>Will break blocks they come into contact with, but are too big to harm Cappy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrows</strong>: Like spikes, but they can fly (keep it moving!)<strong></strong><br><br><br><strong></strong><br></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the brave adventuring duo <i>Cappy &amp; Tappy</i> as they quest through dangerous temples to find treasures lost to time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359860/extras/27e1fba87dec70e304c7dd4bfe5127c3.poster.avif?t=1754408112\" width=1040 height=644 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359860/extras/27e1fba87dec70e304c7dd4bfe5127c3.webm?t=1754408112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359860/extras/27e1fba87dec70e304c7dd4bfe5127c3.mp4?t=1754408112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control both Cappy &amp; Tappy simultaneously for one-of-a-kind solo platforming, or grab a friend and play the fascinating asymmetric co-op mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize both building and platforming to escape with your life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb and leap away from the ever-encroaching, piranha-infested water beneath your feet!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jam out to our original soundtrack, hosting a wide variety of handheld game-inspired tunes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take in the dazzling and varied atmospheres of each unique world that your adventure brings you to!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a constant stream of new mechanics that challenge your skills and invite creative problem solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Champion each world by collecting all of the idols found within!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of the Temples of Peril...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359860/extras/313af0641a1b5c4483195663d57fdf5d.avif?t=1754408112\" width=188 height=174 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Reviews</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I haven't felt platforming this good since super meat boy&quot;</i> - Seth Macy, IGN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I love me a good asymmetrical co-op game&quot; - Kotaku</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I never knew how much I wanted to play Tetris and a 2D platformer at the same time until now!&quot; - mjoldham</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Hazards and Helpers</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359860/extras/e4f430e4f75a5dfe6bf3220d4ec9d1bb.avif?t=1754408112\" width=500 height=500 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campfire</strong>: Respawn points, run through to activate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idol</strong>: Collectables for an extra challenge, not needed to complete the level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spikes: </strong>If hit, you'll respawn at the highest campfire (watch out!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holds</strong>: Grab onto and launch from these for fast and fun traversal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breaker: </strong>Will break blocks they come into contact with, but are too big to harm Cappy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrows</strong>: Like spikes, but they can fly (keep it moving!)<strong></strong><br><br><br><strong></strong><br></p>",
    "short_description": "Cappy &amp; Tappy is a block-stacking platforming adventure! Help the famous adventuring duo Cappy and Tappy escape the crumbling Temples of Peril! Cappy will leap, bound, and climb to escape the temple, while Tappy stacks blocks to aid in the escape.",
